  "en": {
    "kind": "Music for the stage",
    "about": [
      "From the stage show of the same name (Op. 43, 1982–83), directed by Hadjidakis himself, to lyrics by Nikos Gatsos, Aris Davarakis and the composer. A cabaret of songs and ironic “commentaries” — on Sherlock Holmes, Marilyn Monroe, Erik Satie — with new voices of the time, among them Elli Paspala and Ilias Liougkos."
